'''Shaper's Seed''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Agate Amulet}}.

==Mechanics==
Shaper's Seed applies a special [[aura]] that affects nearby allies but not the character.<ref>{{cite web|author=Mark_GGG|date=October 9, 2015|title=Shaper's Seed Aura Question|url=https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/1449241/page/1/#p11839522|publisher=Official Path of Exile Forums|accessdate=October 10, 2015}}</ref>

